{
  "_comment": [
    "Template for .mcp.json (which is gitignored, because the real file holds",
    "credentials). Copy to .mcp.json and fill in the two tokens.",
    "",
    "Note the `--prefer-offline` on every npx invocation. It is load-bearing in",
    "the devcontainer: plain `npx -y` re-fetches the packument from",
    "registry.npmjs.org on every MCP server start, and that host is Cloudflare",
    "anycast whose rotating IPs the egress firewall can only partially pin. A",
    "start that resolves to an unpinned edge hangs until the MCP startup",
    "timeout and the server silently never registers -- the classic",
    "'GitHub MCP works sometimes' symptom. With --prefer-offline, npx serves",
    "from the cache that .devcontainer/post-create.sh warms via `npm install -g`",
    "(which runs before the firewall comes up), so no registry request is made.",
    "",
    "Alternative for a container-only config: drop npx entirely and set",
    "`command` to the globally installed binary -- mcp-server-filesystem,",
    "mcp-server-github, mcp-server-puppeteer, mcp-server-supabase. Most",
    "reliable, but those bins only exist where post-create.sh has run, so it",
    "breaks a host that shares this file over the workspace mount."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "filesystem": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "--prefer-offline",
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem",
        "."
      ]
    },
    "supabase": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "--prefer-offline",
        "-y",
        "@supabase/mcp-server-supabase"
      ],
      "env": {
        "SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN": "<your Supabase personal access token, sbp_...>"
      }
    },
    "puppeteer": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "--prefer-offline",
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-puppeteer"
      ]
    },
    "github": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "--prefer-offline",
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-github"
      ],
      "env": {
        "GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN": "<your GitHub PAT, ghp_...>"
      }
    }
  }
}
